# 统一换行符：仓库内存 LF，检出时由 git 按平台转换。
# 部署脚本必须在 Linux 上以 LF 执行，否则会出现 "\r: command not found"。
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.feather binary
*.npz binary
*.ubj binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.pdf binary
